{"id":13980,"imdb":"tt1121794","en":"Sword of the Stranger","orig":"ストレンヂア -無皇刃譚-","ar":"سيف الغريب","tag":null,"ov":"بينما يطاردهما قتلة صينيون أشداء، يصادف الفتى الصغير (كوتارو) وكلبه غريبًا غامضًا يُدعى (بلا اسم)، والذي يجد نفسه منجرفًا في هذه المطاردة. تنشأ بين هؤلاء الرفقاء غير المتوقعين رابطة قوية بعد إنقاذ الكلب من هجوم بالسم، لكن الفوضى تندلع عندما يعثر القتلة على (كوتارو)، ليضطر (بلا اسم) لمواجهة ماضيه قبل أن يتكرر مصير مأساوي آخر.","rd":"2007-09-29","rt":103,"g":[28,16,36],"lang":"ja","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"BONES","logo":"/cN3JNIKawjOMtfk0GBVIbsx69bg.png","c":"JP"}],"countries":["JP"],"langs":["Mandarin","Japanese"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"JP","d":"2007-09-29"},{"c":"IT","d":"2009-01-30"},{"c":"US","d":"2009-02-05"},{"c":"KR","d":"2009-03-12"},{"c":"FR","d":"2009-05-27"},{"c":"AU","d":"2009-12-02"},{"c":"DE","d":"2010-02-26"},{"c":"ES","d":"2011-07-16"},{"c":"BR","d":"2017-11-21"},{"c":"GB","d":"2017-12-18"}],"dir":["Masahiro Ando"],"prod":["Masahiko Minami"],"wri":["Fumihiko Takayama"],"mus":["Naoki Sato"],"dop":["Yohei Miyahara"],"cast":[{"n":"Tomoya Nagase","ch":"Nameless 'Nanashi' (voice)","p":"/8wa3oPHyTCe5SXm3in5AiU9WQhh.jpg"},{"n":"Yuri Chinen","ch":"Kotaro (voice)","p":"/oamOB16zcCfAOkw7hz3QH2xtHpR.jpg"},{"n":"Koichi Yamadera","ch":"Luo-Lang (voice)","p":"/biov5jENp2XYfehkcdnRvi796Wi.jpg"},{"n":"Akio Otsuka","ch":"Shogen Itadori (voice)","p":"/uH9oiqOOgrsz2zNnouVZ1qPzDyb.jpg"},{"n":"Unsho Ishizuka","ch":"Lord Akaike (voice)","p":"/nmj1vTrJc0zvuUYqxSyWXmIGBlP.jpg"},{"n":"Mamoru Miyano","ch":"Jurota (voice)","p":"/nuok8ueG7k9hPZ09Tpr8e7Qn0ah.jpg"},{"n":"Maaya Sakamoto","ch":"Hagihime (voice)","p":"/jcjTJbxN3rYOtjSJihvbygvEFFZ.jpg"},{"n":"Jun Hazumi","ch":"Zekkai (voice)","p":"/csoVp4ThxFzESS51o0eWg9bYPlM.jpg"},{"n":"Tomoyuki Shimura","ch":"Isogai (voice)","p":"/vHMVy89m2BEr90iHWNd5ZDjyreM.jpg"},{"n":"Takurou Kitagawa","ch":"Fuchinobe (voice)","p":"/mVKkFP25RWiZt91rGoQxqToQDH0.jpg"},{"n":"Atsushi Ii","ch":"Master Bai-Luan (voice)","